    "Age, moulting, daylight, stress and nutrition can change egg numbers. Compare daily records over several weeks rather than assuming disease from one low day. Straining, weakness or a swollen abdomen need prompt veterinary assessment. Do not attempt to remove an egg yourself.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Age, moulting, daylight, stress and nutrition can change egg numbers. Compare daily records over several weeks rather than assuming disease from one low day. Straining, weakness or a swollen abdomen need prompt veterinary assessment. Do not attempt to remove an egg yourself."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Alter, Mauser, Tageslicht, Stress und Ernährung verändern die Legeleistung. Mehrere Wochen vergleichen, statt einen schwachen Tag als Krankheit zu deuten. Pressen, Schwäche oder ein geschwollener Bauch erfordern rasche tierärztliche Abklärung. Nicht selbst ein Ei entfernen."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "L’âge, la mue, la lumière, le stress et l’alimentation influencent la ponte. Comparez plusieurs semaines au lieu de conclure à une maladie après une seule baisse. Efforts de ponte, faiblesse ou abdomen gonflé nécessitent rapidement un vétérinaire. Ne tentez pas de retirer un œuf vous-même."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Idade, muda, luz, estresse e alimentação mudam a postura. Compare registros de várias semanas, sem presumir doença por um único dia baixo. Esforço para pôr, fraqueza ou abdômen inchado exigem avaliação veterinária rápida. Não tente retirar um ovo por conta própria."
          }
        }
      }
    },
