    "Check feather bases, skin and coop crevices for irritation or tiny moving specks. Pale combs, feather damage and reduced laying can have many causes. Record what you see and ask a poultry veterinarian to identify the problem before treatment. Keep bedding clean and inspect the rest of the flock.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Check feather bases, skin and coop crevices for irritation or tiny moving specks. Pale combs, feather damage and reduced laying can have many causes. Record what you see and ask a poultry veterinarian to identify the problem before treatment. Keep bedding clean and inspect the rest of the flock."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Federansätze, Haut und Stallritzen auf Reizung oder kleine bewegliche Punkte prüfen. Blasse Kämme, Federschäden und weniger Eier können viele Ursachen haben. Beobachtungen notieren und vor Behandlung tierärztlich abklären lassen. Einstreu sauber halten und übrige Vögel prüfen."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Inspectez la base des plumes, la peau et les fissures du poulailler. Une crête pâle, des plumes abîmées et une baisse de ponte ont plusieurs causes possibles. Notez vos observations et faites identifier le problème par un vétérinaire avant traitement. Gardez la litière propre et examinez les autres oiseaux."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Examine a base das penas, a pele e frestas do galinheiro. Cristas pálidas, penas danificadas e queda na postura podem ter várias causas. Anote o que observa e peça diagnóstico veterinário antes de tratar. Mantenha a cama limpa e examine as outras aves."
          }
        }
      }
    },
