    "Keep wild birds and rodents away from feed and water. Use dedicated coop footwear and wash hands after handling birds or equipment. Keep new arrivals separate and ask a veterinarian about a suitable quarantine plan. Clean drinkers and keep bedding dry. Avoid sharing equipment between flocks.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keep wild birds and rodents away from feed and water. Use dedicated coop footwear and wash hands after handling birds or equipment. Keep new arrivals separate and ask a veterinarian about a suitable quarantine plan. Clean drinkers and keep bedding dry. Avoid sharing equipment between flocks."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wildvögel und Nager von Futter und Wasser fernhalten. Eigene Stallschuhe tragen und nach Kontakt Hände waschen. Neuzugänge getrennt halten und tierärztlich zur Quarantäne beraten lassen. Tränken reinigen und Einstreu trocken halten. Geräte nicht zwischen Beständen teilen."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Éloignez oiseaux sauvages et rongeurs des aliments et de l’eau. Portez des chaussures réservées au poulailler et lavez-vous les mains après contact. Isolez les nouveaux arrivants et demandez un plan de quarantaine au vétérinaire. Nettoyez les abreuvoirs et gardez la litière sèche. Ne partagez pas le matériel entre élevages."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Afaste aves silvestres e roedores da ração e da água. Use calçados exclusivos no galinheiro e lave as mãos após contato. Separe aves recém-chegadas e consulte o veterinário sobre quarentena. Limpe bebedouros e mantenha a cama seca. Evite compartilhar equipamentos entre criações."
          }
        }
      }
    },
