    "Sudden deaths, severe breathing trouble or several sick birds at once need urgent veterinary advice. Keep people and equipment from moving between flocks. Contact your local animal-health authority about current avian influenza guidance and reporting rules. The offline guide does not provide current outbreak status.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sudden deaths, severe breathing trouble or several sick birds at once need urgent veterinary advice. Keep people and equipment from moving between flocks. Contact your local animal-health authority about current avian influenza guidance and reporting rules. The offline guide does not provide current outbreak status."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Plötzliche Todesfälle, schwere Atemnot oder mehrere kranke Vögel zugleich brauchen sofort tierärztliche Hilfe. Personen und Geräte nicht zwischen Beständen bewegen. Bei der örtlichen Tiergesundheitsbehörde aktuelle Hinweise zur Vogelgrippe und Meldepflicht erfragen. Dieser Offline-Ratgeber zeigt keine aktuelle Seuchenlage."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Morts soudaines, forte gêne respiratoire ou plusieurs oiseaux malades à la fois exigent un avis vétérinaire urgent. Évitez les déplacements de personnes et de matériel entre élevages. Contactez l’autorité sanitaire animale pour les consignes et déclarations liées à la grippe aviaire. Ce guide hors ligne ne donne pas l’état actuel des foyers."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mortes súbitas, dificuldade respiratória grave ou várias aves doentes ao mesmo tempo exigem orientação veterinária urgente. Evite circulação de pessoas e equipamentos entre plantéis. Consulte o serviço local de saúde animal sobre influenza aviária e regras de notificação. Este guia offline não informa surtos atuais."
          }
        }
      }
    },
